    "message": "Return JSON scalars directly when freezing and thawing event payloads\n\n_freeze_json and _thaw_json checked every scalar against typing.Mapping,\nwhose isinstance check goes through typing's slow __instancecheck__. Exact\nJSON scalar types now return at once, and Mapping comes from\ncollections.abc. Other values take the same path as before.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
